  "description": "Meta-package that pulls in GribSharp.Core and the GribSharp.Jpeg2000 add-on, providing full GRIB2 decoding including JPEG2000. Drop-in for previous GribSharp users. Use GribSharp.Core alone to avoid the CSJ2K dependency.",
